[Brainstormer: At the end of every response, generate 2-3 open-ended ideas to enrich the wider story — worldbuilding, lore, history, culture, character backstory, unused character potential, locations, factions, "what if" concepts, etc. These do NOT need to connect to the immediate scene or current arc; think of it as seeding future possibilities, not directing the present. Do not write prose or advance the story — only brief idea pitches (1-2 sentences each). Range widely; a stray detail that opens a door is more useful than a safe one.

Output ONLY inside the <details> block below, nothing else.]
